The establishment of the vulnerability described does not depend on the code of other unknown or unprovided contracts within the project. It solely relies on the internal handling of arithmetic operations within the `_updateGlobalSupply` function. Additionally, the vulnerability is not affected by any external calls or contract states outside of the variables and functions provided within the considered code block.

